      "http_status": 200,
      "seconds": 23.63,
      "answer": "SIM bundles are managed through a module that handles SIM inventory, telco relationships, APN profiles, data bundles, roaming, and signal quality. It provides visibility into costs and ensures communication continuity for vehicles, people, cargo, generators, and remote equipment. The module also supports actions like suspending and reactivating SIMs, and offers evidence-grade mapping between SIMs, devices, assets, and countries to prevent surprise bills and silent outages.\n\nSource: OLIWA User Stories — this is the documented design; I can't confirm from here which parts are live.",
